OL,3,GNEWSAPolice spend #800k on protests at
OL,4,Adog-breeding site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has spent about #800,000
OL,7,Fpolicing planned protests over the last
OL,8,Ffive years outside a facility that
OL,9,Fbreeds dogs for laboratory research.
OL,11,FActivists began demonstrating outside
OL,12,FMBR Acres in Wyton, near Huntingdon,
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, in 2021 to demand that
OL,14,Fthe site be closed and the dogs inside
OL,15,Fbe released.
OL,17,FCambridgeshire Constabulary said its
OL,18,Fpolicing of planned protests at the
OL,19,Ffacility was "impartial and
OL,20,Fproportionate".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
