OL,3,GNEWSAPolice spend #800k on protests at
OL,4,Adog-breeding site
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarshall Bio Resources (MBR), which
OL,7,Fruns the site, said it was
OL,8,F"disappointed" to see the amount of
OL,9,Fmoney spent policing the protests.
